WEBVTT

00:07.827 --> 00:09.103
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.172 --> 00:10.793
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.862 --> 00:12.275
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.344 --> 00:14.241
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.310 --> 00:17.275
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.344 --> 00:19.379
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.448 --> 00:21.379
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.448 --> 00:23.275
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.344 --> 00:24.965
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.034 --> 00:27.413
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.482 --> 00:29.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.275 --> 00:31.413
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.482 --> 00:33.379
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.448 --> 00:35.241
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.310 --> 00:37.379
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.448 --> 00:39.482
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.551 --> 00:40.827
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.896 --> 00:42.689
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.758 --> 00:45.241
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.310 --> 00:47.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.793 --> 00:49.344
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.448 --> 00:56.379
[buoyant music]
[轻快的音乐]

00:56.448 --> 01:03.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:07.310 --> 01:09.482
- [yawns] Whoa.
- [哈欠] 哇哦。

01:09.551 --> 01:11.413
- [high-pitched grumbling] Oh!
- [高声抱怨]哦！

01:11.482 --> 01:13.344
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:13.413 --> 01:15.172
Huh?
啊？

01:15.241 --> 01:18.103
[whimpers] Ma? Pa?
[呜咽]妈？爸？

01:18.172 --> 01:21.413
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

01:21.482 --> 01:23.517
- I'm Gale Doppler
with the big weather!
- 我是盖尔·多普勒
随着大天气！

01:23.586 --> 01:26.206
Well just as I predicted,
those severe thunderstorms
嗯，正如我所预料的那样，
那些猛烈的雷暴

01:26.275 --> 01:28.620
are moving to the southeast,
and I guarantee
正在向东南方向移动，
我保证

01:28.689 --> 01:30.413
it's gonna be nothing
but sunny skies
不会有事的
但天空晴朗

01:30.482 --> 01:31.793
for the rest of the week.
本周剩下的时间。

01:31.862 --> 01:33.655
This is Gale Doppler,
and I broadcast
这是大风多普勒，
我广播

01:33.724 --> 01:35.724
the forecast
that's never wrong!
预测
那永远不会错！

01:35.793 --> 01:37.137
Heh heh.
呵呵。

01:37.206 --> 01:38.758
- [panting] Huh?
- [气喘吁吁] 啊？

01:38.827 --> 01:41.241
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

01:41.310 --> 01:43.275
Whoa--boing!
Hah!
哇——呸！
哈！

01:43.344 --> 01:45.862
Sunny skies all week?
整个星期天气晴朗？

01:45.931 --> 01:48.586
Hot diggity!
[mutters]
热数字！
[嘀咕]

01:48.655 --> 01:51.137
[hums] Ah.
[哼哼]啊。

01:52.379 --> 01:53.310
Rain.
雨。

01:53.379 --> 01:54.827
But--but
但是——但是

01:54.896 --> 01:57.310
Gale Doppler
is never wrong.
大风多普勒
永远不会错。

01:57.379 --> 02:00.206
Huh? Hm.
啊？嗯。

02:00.275 --> 02:02.793
[mumbles] What...?
[咕哝]什么……？

02:02.862 --> 02:07.000
- [sobbing]
- Hm?
- [抽泣]
- 嗯？

02:07.068 --> 02:10.172
Aw, it's a little baby
storm cloud.
哇，是个小宝宝
风暴云。

02:11.103 --> 02:13.586
Hello, little cloud.
Nice to meet you.
你好，小云。
很高兴见到你。

02:13.655 --> 02:15.379
- [weeping]
- [哭泣]

02:15.448 --> 02:19.034
- Oh, you're crying.
I thought you were raining.
- 哦，你在哭。
我还以为你下雨了

02:19.103 --> 02:21.137
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:21.206 --> 02:22.724
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

02:22.793 --> 02:24.379
- Oh, now don't be scared.
- 哦，现在别害怕。

02:24.448 --> 02:27.413
SpongeBob knows just what
a growing storm cloud needs.
海绵宝宝知道什么
不断增长的风暴云需求。

02:27.482 --> 02:30.241
Huhh. Hot steam.
呵呵。热蒸汽。

02:30.310 --> 02:31.689
[kisses]
[亲吻]

02:31.758 --> 02:36.310
Mm. Hm-hm-hm-hmm.
Mm-hmm.
毫米。嗯-嗯-嗯-嗯。
嗯嗯。

02:36.379 --> 02:37.517
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

02:37.586 --> 02:39.379
[enthusiastic muttering]
[热情的嘀咕]

02:39.448 --> 02:41.310
[slurping]
[发出声音]

02:44.551 --> 02:46.586
[sighs]
[叹气]

02:46.655 --> 02:48.137
Huh?
[whimpers]
啊？
[呜咽]

02:48.206 --> 02:51.103
- Well, okay,
I don't see any clouds,
- 嗯，好吧，
我看不到任何云彩

02:51.172 --> 02:54.758
so I'm just gonna take a walk.
- Huh?
所以我要去散步。
- 啊？

02:54.827 --> 02:57.793
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

02:57.862 --> 03:00.206
Tut, tut, it looks like rain.
啧啧，看来要下雨了。

03:00.275 --> 03:01.827
Hah!
哈！

03:02.758 --> 03:04.931
Oh, hello there.
哦，你好。

03:07.482 --> 03:09.551
Aw, who's a cute cumulous?
哦，谁是可爱的积木？

03:09.620 --> 03:12.448
I always wanted to have
a pet cloud formation.
我一直想拥有
宠物云的形成。

03:12.517 --> 03:14.620
I'm gonna name you...
我会给你起名字...

03:14.689 --> 03:16.862
[gasps] Drizzle.
[喘气]毛毛雨。

03:16.931 --> 03:18.758
[giggling] Whoo.
[咯咯笑] 哇。

03:18.827 --> 03:20.517
Whoo--
呼——

03:20.586 --> 03:22.931
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

03:24.827 --> 03:27.413
- Hey, good visibility!
- 嘿，能见度好！

03:27.482 --> 03:29.655
[muttering]
[嘀咕]

03:29.724 --> 03:32.172
[laughs]
- [inhaling]
[笑]
- [吸气]

03:32.241 --> 03:33.931
- Wha! Oh.
- 世界卫生大会！哦。

03:34.000 --> 03:36.482
And gusty winds
from the southeast.
还有狂风
从东南方向。

03:36.551 --> 03:38.344
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

03:39.620 --> 03:40.689
- [beeping]
- Um.
- [嘟嘟声]
- 嗯。

03:40.758 --> 03:42.034
A clam eating a telephone.
一只蛤蜊正在吃电话。

03:42.103 --> 03:43.931
- [pop]
- A fur chandelier!
- [流行音乐]
- 毛皮吊灯！

03:44.000 --> 03:46.551
A lamp! A shoe factory!
一盏灯！鞋厂！

03:46.620 --> 03:48.172
A continental breakfast!
欧陆式早餐！

03:48.241 --> 03:50.000
- Ooh.
- A chicken!
- 哦。
- 一只鸡！

03:50.068 --> 03:53.068
- [clucks]
- Oh, I am so good at this.
- [咯咯笑]
- 哦，我很擅长这个。

03:53.137 --> 03:55.482
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:55.551 --> 03:56.931
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

03:57.000 --> 03:58.586
[both snarl]
[双方咆哮]

03:58.655 --> 04:00.724
- [barking]
- [straining]
- [吠叫]
- [紧张]

04:00.793 --> 04:02.551
- [screeches]
- [尖叫声]

04:04.000 --> 04:06.310
- Sorry. Ee...
- 对不起。呃……

04:08.103 --> 04:10.310
Bad Drizzle. Bad.
糟糕的毛毛雨。坏的。

04:10.379 --> 04:12.241
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

04:12.310 --> 04:14.517
Well, all right, not that bad.
嗯，好吧，没那么糟糕。

04:14.586 --> 04:16.068
Okay, let's go home.
好吧，我们回家吧。

04:16.137 --> 04:18.344
- [panting]
- [giggles]
- [气喘吁吁]
- [咯咯笑]

04:20.827 --> 04:23.620
I'm sorry Drizzle,
but you can't go in the house
对不起，小雨，
但你不能进屋

04:23.689 --> 04:27.137
until you're housebroken.
直到你家破人亡。

04:27.206 --> 04:28.034
- [meows]
- [喵]

04:28.103 --> 04:29.620
- I'll check on you later.
- 我稍后会查看你的情况。

04:29.689 --> 04:33.551
- [whimpers, straining]
- [呜咽，紧张]

04:33.620 --> 04:35.413
[continues straining]
[继续紧张]

04:36.482 --> 04:37.724
[thunder booming]
[雷霆轰鸣]

04:37.793 --> 04:39.517
[lightning crackles]
[闪电爆裂声]

04:39.586 --> 04:40.827
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

04:40.896 --> 04:42.172
- It's later!
- 稍后！

04:42.241 --> 04:46.310
Who wants a steaming hot bowl
of steam?
谁想要一碗热气腾腾的
蒸汽？

04:46.379 --> 04:48.724
Ah! Drizzle!
啊!细雨！

04:48.793 --> 04:51.551
Yow! Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!
哟！热，热，热，热，热！

04:51.620 --> 04:53.448
Where art thou, Drizzle?
小雨，你在哪里？

04:53.517 --> 04:56.896
Oh, what unfortunate forecast
be this.
噢，多么不幸的预测啊
是这个。

04:56.965 --> 04:59.620
[whimpers]--oh wait,
there he goes.
[呜咽]——哦等等，
他就在那里。

04:59.689 --> 05:01.103
Come back, Drizzle!
回来吧，小雨！

05:01.172 --> 05:03.413
[wailing] Come back!
[哀嚎]回来吧！

05:03.482 --> 05:05.241
- Whoa!
- 哇！

05:05.310 --> 05:06.793
- Oh, get off the road!
- 哦，离开马路！

05:06.862 --> 05:08.000
[horn blaring]
[喇叭声]

05:08.068 --> 05:09.862
- [wailing, groaning]
- [哀号，呻吟]

05:09.931 --> 05:12.482
[shrieking]
[尖叫]

05:12.551 --> 05:13.931
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

05:14.000 --> 05:15.517
[snails hissing]
[蜗牛嘶嘶声]

05:15.586 --> 05:18.586
[panicked yelling]
[惊慌失措的叫喊]

05:20.103 --> 05:22.241
- It's raining snails
and worms!
- 下着蜗牛雨
还有蠕虫！

05:22.310 --> 05:24.896
[thud]
[panicked wailing]
[砰]
[惊慌的哀号]

05:24.965 --> 05:26.172
- That's impossible!
- 那是不可能的！

05:26.241 --> 05:28.931
I called for sunny skies
and for 35 years
我呼唤晴朗的天空
35年来

05:29.000 --> 05:32.034
I broadcast the forecast
that's never wrong.
我广播了天气预报
那永远不会错。

05:32.103 --> 05:34.551
[both growling]
[双方咆哮]

05:34.620 --> 05:38.034
[blows landing, hissing]
[吹气着陆，嘶嘶声]

05:38.103 --> 05:42.758
- This just in:
Gale Doppler is wrong!
- 这只是在：
大风多普勒是错误的！

05:42.827 --> 05:44.689
- [laughs awkwardly]
Huh?
- [尴尬地笑]
啊？

05:44.758 --> 05:47.620
[panicked yelling]
[zapping]
[惊慌失措的叫喊]
[电击]

05:49.275 --> 05:52.310
[grunts] Ah! I see the trouble
now, folks.
[咕哝]啊！我看到了麻烦
现在，伙计们。

05:52.379 --> 05:55.551
That is what they call
an unpredictable storm front.
这就是他们所说的
不可预测的风暴锋

05:55.620 --> 05:56.965
But don't worry.
但不用担心。

05:57.034 --> 05:58.896
[whirring]
[呼呼]

05:58.965 --> 06:00.689
I'm gonna suck him
right out of the sky
我要吸他
就在天上

06:00.758 --> 06:03.793
to save my reputation,
after these messages.
为了挽救我的名誉，
在这些消息之后。

06:03.862 --> 06:05.827
- Are you constipated?
- 你便秘吗？

06:05.896 --> 06:07.482
Sure, we all are.
当然，我们都是。

06:07.551 --> 06:09.586
Thank goodness there's new--
- Drizzle!
谢天谢地，又有新的了——
- 毛毛雨！

06:09.655 --> 06:11.413
Drizzle, where are you?
Excuse me.
细雨，你在哪里？
打扰一下。

06:11.482 --> 06:13.965
Have you seen a little storm
cloud about yea big?
你见过一场小风暴吗
云大约有多大？

06:14.034 --> 06:16.862
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

06:16.931 --> 06:19.275
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

06:19.344 --> 06:20.862
Ah!
啊!

06:20.931 --> 06:23.931
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

06:24.000 --> 06:26.896
[whirring]
[呼呼]

06:26.965 --> 06:28.931
[straining]
- I got him!
[紧张]
- 我抓到他了！

06:29.000 --> 06:32.379
Naughty nimbus, nobody messes
with my flawless forecasts.
顽皮的雨云，没人惹事
和我完美的预测。

06:32.448 --> 06:36.827
It's back to sunny skies
for Bikini Bottom.
又回到了晴朗的天空
比基尼泳裤。

06:36.896 --> 06:39.000
- Drizzle! Drizzle!
- 毛毛雨！细雨！

06:39.068 --> 06:40.413
Drizzle!
细雨！

06:40.482 --> 06:42.862
Oh, there you are, Drizzle.
[gasps]
噢，你来了，小雨。
[喘气]

06:42.931 --> 06:44.620
Gale Doppler!
强风多普勒！

06:44.689 --> 06:46.896
You're my favorite
wall-eyed weather man!
你是我的最爱
目光短浅的天气预报员！

06:46.965 --> 06:49.827
Oh, thanks for finding
my lost pet, Mr. Doppler.
哦，谢谢你找到了
我丢失的宠物，多普勒先生。

06:49.896 --> 06:51.758
Time to go home, Drizzle.
是时候回家了，小雨。

06:51.827 --> 06:53.344
- I'm sorry, square face.
- 对不起，方脸。

06:53.413 --> 06:55.275
This cloud is a danger
to the public.
这朵云是危险的
向公众。

06:55.344 --> 06:57.448
And I'm sending him straight
to cloud heaven.
我直接发给他
到云天。

06:57.517 --> 06:59.482
- [whimpering]
[whirring]
- [呜咽]
[呼呼]

06:59.551 --> 07:00.689
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

07:00.758 --> 07:04.379
- [whimpering, wails]
- [呜咽，哀号]

07:04.448 --> 07:05.586
- [laughs]
- [笑]

07:05.655 --> 07:07.068
I'm Gale Doppler,
我是盖尔·多普勒

07:07.137 --> 07:09.310
and I con-trol the weather.
我控制天气。

07:09.379 --> 07:11.862
[laughing]
- Hey, Doppler.
[笑]
- 嘿，多普勒。

07:11.931 --> 07:13.413
You're not the only one
who knows
你不是唯一一个
谁知道

07:13.482 --> 07:15.793
how to use a leaf blower,
sucker.
如何使用吹叶机，
傻瓜。

07:15.862 --> 07:17.310
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:17.379 --> 07:18.344
- Huh?
- 啊？

07:18.413 --> 07:20.551
Hm. Blah!
嗯。废话！

07:20.620 --> 07:23.896
- Hm? [snarls]
- 嗯？ [咆哮]

07:23.965 --> 07:25.448
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:25.517 --> 07:27.379
- Hm? Aha!
- 嗯？啊哈！

07:28.862 --> 07:31.034
- Huh?
- [panting]
- 啊？
- [气喘吁吁]

07:31.103 --> 07:33.034
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

07:33.103 --> 07:35.448
- Huh? Ah.
- Ah!
- 啊？啊。
- 啊！

07:35.517 --> 07:37.379
Yah-whoo-ah!
啊呼啊！

07:38.000 --> 07:39.241
We did it, Drizzle.
我们做到了，细雨。

07:39.310 --> 07:41.413
We put a stoppler
to the doppler.
我们放了一个塞子
到多普勒。

07:41.482 --> 07:45.000
And I predict sunny skies
for the rest of our lives.
我预测晴空万里
我们的余生。

07:45.068 --> 07:47.517
Whoa! Ah!
哇！啊!

07:50.000 --> 07:52.896
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

07:52.965 --> 07:55.310
[wailing]
[哀号]

07:55.379 --> 07:58.620
- Ooh! That's a nasty low
pressure system from the north!
- 哦！这是一个令人讨厌的低点
来自北方的压力系统！

07:58.689 --> 08:01.206
- [straining]
- [紧张]

08:01.275 --> 08:03.517
[coughing, sputters]
[咳嗽、口吐白沫]

08:03.586 --> 08:04.758
[retches]
[干呕]

08:04.827 --> 08:06.310
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

08:06.379 --> 08:08.344
- [panicked muttering]
- [惊慌的嘀咕]

08:09.172 --> 08:13.310
Please, Mr. Doppler, don't
send Drizzle to cloud heaven!
多普勒先生，请不要
送小雨到云天！

08:13.379 --> 08:15.103
- That's just an expression.
- 这只是一个表达。

08:15.172 --> 08:16.862
He's not going anywhere.
他哪儿也不去。

08:16.931 --> 08:18.344
- Phew, that's a relief.
- 唷，这真是一种解脱。

08:18.413 --> 08:19.896
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

08:19.965 --> 08:22.310
- I'm gonna drop him
in this dehumidifier
-我要丢下他了
在这个除湿机里

08:22.379 --> 08:24.241
and dissolve him.
并解散他。

08:24.310 --> 08:25.758
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

08:25.827 --> 08:27.310
- Dissolve him? What?
- 解散他？什么？

08:27.379 --> 08:30.482
Please, Mr. Doppler!
Drizzler's a good cloud!
拜托，多普勒先生！
毛毛雨真是一朵好云！

08:30.551 --> 08:33.344
He doesn't deserve to dissolve!
他不配解散！

08:33.413 --> 08:35.241
[crying]
[哭泣]

08:35.310 --> 08:37.379
[somber string music]
[忧郁的弦乐]

08:37.448 --> 08:39.551
- I've got zero visibility.
- 我的能见度为零。

08:39.620 --> 08:42.068
Let go of my eyes, square face!
放开我的眼睛，方脸！

08:45.137 --> 08:46.827
- [sobbing] Drizzle!
- [抽泣]毛毛雨！

08:46.896 --> 08:49.517
[rumbling, mechanical creaking]
[隆隆声，机械嘎吱声]

08:49.586 --> 08:51.137
- [straining]
- [紧张]

08:51.206 --> 08:53.793
[thunder rumbling]
[雷声隆隆]

08:53.862 --> 08:55.758
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

08:55.827 --> 08:57.275
- [nervous giggling]
- [紧张的咯咯笑]

08:57.344 --> 09:01.275
- I'm in the middle
of a severe thunderstorm--
- 我在中间
一场强烈的雷暴——

09:01.344 --> 09:04.000
And we're bringing it
to you li--
我们带来了它
给你李--

09:04.068 --> 09:06.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:06.137 --> 09:07.758
[audio feedback]
[音频反馈]

09:07.827 --> 09:09.793
- Wha!
- 世界卫生大会！

09:09.862 --> 09:12.689
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

09:15.827 --> 09:18.517
[muffled whimpering]
[低沉的呜咽声]

09:18.586 --> 09:20.275
Hm. [spits]
嗯。 [吐口水]

09:20.344 --> 09:22.448
I'm Gale Doppler,
我是盖尔·多普勒

09:22.517 --> 09:25.896
and I actually  am
the weather!
而我实际上是
天气！

09:25.965 --> 09:27.344
[laughing]
[笑]

09:27.413 --> 09:29.137
[thunder rumbling]
Huh?
[雷声隆隆]
啊？

09:29.206 --> 09:30.896
Huh?
啊？

09:30.965 --> 09:32.724
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

09:32.793 --> 09:35.241
- Uh-oh. [grunts]
- 呃哦。 [咕哝]

09:35.310 --> 09:38.137
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:38.206 --> 09:41.517
[all screaming, wailing]
[所有人尖叫、哀号]

09:44.068 --> 09:48.068
- [shivering] My body is cold.
- [发抖] 我的身体很冷。

09:49.344 --> 09:51.655
I don't want to be
the weather anymore.
我不想成为
天气不再了。

09:51.724 --> 09:53.103
It hurts!
好痛！

09:53.172 --> 09:55.000
[wailing]
[哀号]

09:55.068 --> 09:56.344
- Excuse me, Drizzle.
- 对不起，小雨。

09:56.413 --> 09:58.206
I don't mean to parade
on your rain,
我不是故意要游行
在你的雨中，

09:58.275 --> 10:00.655
but could you please
put Gale down?
但可以请你吗
放下盖尔？

10:00.724 --> 10:02.689
Whoa-whoa, whoa!
哇哇哇！

10:02.758 --> 10:05.896
Whoa! [screams]
哇！ [尖叫声]

10:05.965 --> 10:08.344
Ooh. Hm. Hm?
哦。嗯。嗯？

10:08.413 --> 10:12.172
Huh? Oh, no!
Not more storm clouds.
啊？哦，不！
不再有暴风云。

10:12.241 --> 10:14.931
- Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
- 哇！哇！哇！

10:15.000 --> 10:17.586
[thunder booming]
[雷霆轰鸣]

10:17.655 --> 10:20.758
- No! [sputters]
- 不！ [溅射声]

10:20.827 --> 10:23.000
- What? [laughs]
- 什么？ [笑]

10:23.068 --> 10:25.344
- [spits]
- Aw.
- [吐口水]
- 噢。

10:25.413 --> 10:27.413
[chatters happily]
[开心地聊天]

10:27.482 --> 10:30.931
- Holy hurricane,
they're Drizzle's parents!
- 神圣飓风，
他们是小雨的父母！

10:31.000 --> 10:32.344
- Mm, mm.
- 嗯，嗯。

10:32.413 --> 10:34.793
[muttering sternly]
[严厉地嘀咕]

10:34.862 --> 10:36.517
[thunder rumbling]
[雷声隆隆]

10:36.586 --> 10:38.965
- You know, everybody complains
about the weather,
- 你知道，每个人都在抱怨
关于天气，

10:39.034 --> 10:41.827
but my next guests actually do
something about it.
但我的下一位客人确实这么做了
关于它的一些事情。

10:41.896 --> 10:44.758
Did you two always want
to be storm clouds?
你们两个一直想要吗
成为暴风云？

10:44.827 --> 10:46.482
[both inhaling]
[双方吸气]

10:46.551 --> 10:49.827
- I'm Gale Doppler, and I could
probably use an ambulance,
- 我是盖尔·多普勒，我可以
可能使用救护车，

10:49.896 --> 10:52.034
right about now!
就现在！

10:52.103 --> 10:53.965
[yelps]
[machinery grinding]
[尖叫声]
【机械磨削】

10:54.034 --> 10:55.689
[explosion booms]
[爆炸声]

10:55.758 --> 10:57.758
[shimmering]
[闪烁]

10:57.827 --> 10:59.172
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

10:59.241 --> 11:01.586
- Good-bye, my little
foul weather friend.
- 再见，我的小宝贝
天气不好的朋友。

11:01.655 --> 11:04.482
I'll never forget you,
come rain or shine.
我永远不会忘记你
风雨无阻。

11:04.551 --> 11:06.068
[kisses]
[亲吻]

11:06.137 --> 11:08.827
- Huh? [whimpers]
- 啊？ [呜咽]

11:10.413 --> 11:12.586
- Aw, thank you, Drizzle.
- 哦，谢谢你，毛毛雨。

11:12.655 --> 11:16.379
Don't worry. I'll water him
and walk him every day.
不用担心。我给他浇水
并每天陪他散步。

11:16.448 --> 11:18.344
- Whoo-hoo!
- Bye!
- 呼呼！
- 再见！

11:18.413 --> 11:19.758
- [squeaking]
- [吱吱声]

11:19.827 --> 11:24.068
- Aw, I'm gonna name you
"Drizzle Junior."
- 哦，我要给你起名字
“小雨少年。”

11:24.137 --> 11:26.068
And I know just where
to keep you too.
我知道在哪里
也留住你。

11:26.137 --> 11:28.000
all: Aw.
全体：噢。

11:28.068 --> 11:29.172
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

11:29.241 --> 11:31.413
- Aw--[groans]
- 噢--[呻吟]

11:33.068 --> 11:34.827
[bright guitar music]
[明亮的吉他音乐]

11:34.896 --> 11:37.137
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

11:37.206 --> 11:39.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:39.068 --> 11:40.724
Good morning, Drizzle Junior.
早上好，小毛毛雨。

11:40.793 --> 11:43.758
Not too hot but not too cold.
- Uh-huh.
不太热但也不太冷。
- 呃哈。

11:43.827 --> 11:46.965
- [opera singing]
- [歌剧演唱]

11:47.034 --> 11:50.931
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

11:51.000 --> 11:58.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪